Then you click into the activity.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.759
And then you go ahead and you can see what each of those are.

00:00:20.759 --> 00:00:22.800
So we have light or nitric oxide or.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.700
cytokine growth factor, or hormones and we can go ahead

